{"id":"n90013-1-2","stage":2,"title":"토 · 星期六","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n90013-1-2-1","ko":"민준아, 너 여행 간다면서?","zh":"敏俊啊，你不是要去旅行吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"민준아,","meaning":"敏俊","explanation":"민준：敏俊；아：呼格助词，用来称呼关系亲近的人或晚辈。","readings":[{"term":"민준아","audio":"/audio/8016ce64193f3153a82a.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"너","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"여행","meaning":"旅行，旅游","explanation":"여행：旅行，旅游","readings":[{"term":"여행","audio":"/audio/b5d87b0a7b5d6b82f2a8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28026","senseId":"1","lemma":"여행","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"간다면서?","meaning":"去","explanation":"가다：去；ㄴ다면서：引用所听到的话，向对方确认，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"14","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"b5d87b0a7b5d6b82","term":"여행","zh":"旅行，旅游","audio":"/audio/b5d87b0a7b5d6b82f2a8.mp3","entryId":"28026","definition":"离开家，去其他地区或国外游玩的行为。","pronunciation":["여행"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"为做某事而向别的地方移动。","pronunciation":["가다"]}],"audio":"/audio/084efa4f27d6af9a4737.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n90013-1-2-2","ko":"응, 이번 주 목, 금, 토가 휴가거든.","zh":"对，这周的周四、周五、周六我有假期。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응,","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2","lemma":"응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"이번","meaning":"这次，这回","explanation"